---
# Qt Test assertion macros (QCOMPARE/QVERIFY/...) expand to several statements
# each, so an ordinary test function blows past the shared readability-function-
# size thresholds even when it is only a handful of source lines. The waiting
# macros (QTRY_*) additionally expand into nested loops and branches, which
# pushes a one-line wait past the nesting threshold. Inherit every other check
# from the repository config and relax only the size heuristic here.
InheritParentConfig: true
CheckOptions:
  readability-function-size.LineThreshold: 200
  readability-function-size.StatementThreshold: 200
  readability-function-size.NestingThreshold: 8
